  "citation": "Oren R; Kim D; Oishi A C; Ward E (2022): Duke Forest FACE (FACTS-I): Meteorological and Soil Data. Duke Forest FACE - Forest-Atmosphere Carbon Transfer and Storage (FACTS-I). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1895465",
